 "source_ranks": {"bm25": 7, "dense": 12}, "source_contributions": {"bm25": 0.014925373, "dense": 0.013888889}, "text": "发票必须在订单状态变为“已完成”后的 17 个自然日内申请。超过时限的订单需要联系人工客服，并提交未及时申请的原因；客服受理不代表一定能够补开。\n\n发票开具后会发送到订单绑定邮箱。已经开具的发票如需修改抬头，必须先完成原发票红冲，再重新提交开票信息。", "start_char": 97, "end_char": 222, "metadata": {"title": "青岚商城电子发票规则", "source": "synthetic/qinglan-invoice-v1", "version": "2026-07", "chunk_index": 1}}, {"rank": 11, "chunk_id": "qinglan-membership-v1#chunk-002", "document_id": "qinglan-membership-v1", "score": 0.028778468, "source_count": 2, "best_source_rank": 9, "source_ranks": {"bm25": 9, "dense": 10}, "source_contributions": {"bm25": 0.014492754, "dense": 0.014285714}, "text": "期时，升级会延迟到观察期结束。\n\n金卡资格有效期为十二个月。有效期内再次获得 900 点成长值可以续期，否则到期后恢复为普通会员。", "start_char": 164, "end_char": 229, "metadata": {"title": "青岚会员等级说明", "source": "synthetic/qinglan-membership-v1", "version": "2026-07", "chunk_index": 2}}, {"rank": 12, "chunk_id": "qinglan-membership-v1#chunk-001", "document_id": "qinglan-membership-v1", "score": 0.028169014, "source_count": 2, "best_source_rank": 11, "source_ranks": {"bm25": 11, "dense": 11}, "source_contributions": {"bm25": 0.014084507, "dense": 0.014084507}, "text": "入成长值。发生部分退款时，系统按退款金额扣回相应成长值。\n\n等级规则：普通会员在连续十二个月内累计获得 1360 点成长值后，于次日自动升级为金卡会员。成长值达到门槛但订单仍处于售后观察期时，升级会延迟到观察期结束。\n\n金卡资格有效期为十二个月。", "start_char": 71, "end_char": 194, "metadata": {"title": "青岚会员等级说明", "source": "synthetic/qinglan-membership-v1", "version": "2026-07", "chunk_index": 1}}], "query": "青岚智能设备主体的有限保修期是多久？", "question_id": "q04", "expected_answer": "22 个月", "gold_document_id": "qinglan-warranty-v1", "gold_document_best_rank": 1, "gold_answer_best_rank": 1, "document_hit_at_1": true, "document_hit_at_3": true, "answer_hit_at_1": true, "answer_hit_at_3": true}
